commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/deployments","created_at":"2019-07-13T09:09:37Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T06:22:21Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-12T22:06:32Z","git_url":"git://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:tauri-apps/tauri.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri","homepage":"https://tauri.app","size":100473,"stargazers_count":99901,"watchers_count":99901,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":3226,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1282,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["desktop-app","high-performance","mobile-app","native-app","rust","web-frontend","webview"],"visibility":"public","forks":3226,"open_issues":1282,"watchers":99901,"default_branch":"dev","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"### Describe the bug\r\n\r\nHigh memory usage when sending lots of commands for rust from js.\r\n\r\n### Reproduction\r\n\r\nInvoke a command in an interval:\r\n```js\r\nsetInterval(() => {\r\n  invoke<number[][]>('get_data', args).then(drawOnHtmlCanvasElement)\r\n}, 50)\r\n```\r\n\r\nReturn large amount of data from rust to js:\r\n```rs\r\n#[tauri::command]\r\nfn get_data(path: &str, start: u64, length: usize, filters: Vec<FilterConfig>) -> Vec<Vec<f32>> {\r\n    vec![vec![0.0; 2560]; 21]\r\n    // data::get(path, start, length, filters)\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter several thousand invocations, watch memory usage creep up:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16892444/166257302-6bc63416-c4cf-4f87-9954-21782188bd37.png)\r\n\r\nEventually, when memory pressure is sufficient, the usage plateaus. It appears that garbage collection runs regularly, reducing the memory usage of both the processes that hog memory.\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nI would expect the app to run without hogging memory resources.\r\n\r\n### Platform and versions\r\n\r\n```shell\r\n> tauri-app@0.1.0 tauri\r\n> tauri \"info\"\r\n\r\n\r\nEnvironment\r\n  › OS: Mac OS 12.2.1 X64\r\n  › Node.js: 16.13.1\r\n  › npm: 8.1.2\r\n  › pnpm: Not installed!\r\n  › yarn: Not installed!\r\n  › rustup: 1.24.3\r\n  › rustc: 1.57.0\r\n  › cargo: 1.57.0\r\n  › Rust toolchain: stable-aarch64-apple-darwin \r\n\r\nPackages\r\n  › @tauri-apps/cli [NPM]: 1.0.0-rc.9\r\n  › @tauri-apps/api [NPM]: 1.0.0-rc.4\r\n  › tauri [RUST]: 1.0.0-rc.8,\r\n  › tauri-build [RUST]: 1.0.0-rc.7,\r\n  › tao [RUST]: 0.8.3,\r\n  › wry [RUST]: 0.15.1,\r\n\r\nApp\r\n  › build-type: bundle\r\n  › CSP: unset\r\n  › distDir: ../build\r\n  › devPath: http://localhost:3000/\r\n  › framework: React\r\n\r\nApp directory structure\r\n  ├─ node_modules\r\n  ├─ public\r\n  ├─ src-tauri\r\n  ├─ build\r\n  ├─ .git\r\n  └─ src\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Stack trace\r\n\r\n```shell\r\nN/A\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Additional context\r\n\r\nThe `get_data` command only needs 5ms on my machine. That means the interval is not running too fast, since it has > 40ms of rest time between invocations.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/4026/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/4026/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/comments/2309774679","html_url":"https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/852#issuecomment-2309774679","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/852","id":2309774679,"node_id":"IC_kwDOC7lts86JrF1X","user":{"login":"DennisZhangOiler","id":152133394,"node_id":"U_kgDOCRFfEg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152133394?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisZhangOiler","html_url":"https://github.com/DennisZhangOiler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisZhangOiler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisZhangOiler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisZhangOiler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisZhangOiler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisZhangOiler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisZhangOiler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisZhangOiler/repos","events_url":"https://api.